          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "weŋŋili chimbaŋu mutabanaka, wemi kili ihina dakujika nachu hakachi, waji kilu muchimbaŋu chawunsahu; mwomwamulejeluwu Mosi kudi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
