        {
          "text": "Washilikameŋa kahimulambu wakushita kuchisu chatabanaka detenti dakubulakena, wakandamishiluhu himulambu wakushita, nihimulambu wawuŋa; mwomwa mulejelu wuMosi kudi Yehova.",
