              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ivu daYehova dadipi hatabanaka namwa ana, mukachi kadu mwadiŋi kesi nawufuku, kumesu awakwamutaŋa waIsarela ejima, mwomwendeleluwu mukwendakwawu kwejima.",
